  "question": {
    "text": "Let the maximum and minimum value of the expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> respectively, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is, (where [.] is the greatest integer function)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Given expression is maximum when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and minimum when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
  }
}